	 ('48da673c-c073-46ae-a14e-468eb5c6ba23','Luka 2 PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"Cushioned for Impact","body":["When you''re shifting side to side, you need support that''s firm—but not rigid. A wedge of cushioning in the midsole butts up against the medial sidewall so you can bank like a champ, and a thick, moulded insole helps you stay grounded."]},{"header":"Last-Step Efficiency","body":["The other aspect of side-to-side movement? Lateral support. To help your quick stops feel secure, we added a strong, flexible plate that runs up the lateral side wall, complemented by a firm foam carrier and Formula 23 foam in the midsole."]},{"header":"360 Degrees of Support","body":["A sturdy cage wraps around the entire upper for 360-degree connected support that help your feet stay securely contained, whichever way you step—or however quick you stop."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: White/Hyper Pink/Black","Style: DX9012-106","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/2ba84c98-37f8-4bb3-96fb-33b72d6b4601/JORDAN+LUKA+2+PF.png','994.36','2025-01-03 15:45:48.044841','2025-01-03 15:45:48.044841','football','men'),
	 ('a097ab31-37a1-4ea6-8167-1f3fdd7bac46','LeBron Witness 8 EP','{"benefits":[{"header":"Max Air made","body":["A Max Air unit in the low-profile midsole is combined with a foam wrap-up for support when you''re moving in lateral directions. It helps cushion your landing while supporting the smooth transition from heel to toe. It also provides side-to-side stability and helps harness and direct your force."]},{"header":"Secure feel","body":["Breathable mesh provides a lightweight, conforming fit in the upper, from the webbing that harnesses your forefoot to the external moulded pieces that help secure your heel. Reinforced stitching along the sides helps the shoe fit snugly for full-foot containment."]},{"header":"Stick and Move","body":["We split the rubber outsole and partially cut it out under the arch to help it bend and flex while helping reduce its overall weight. A classic herringbone pattern adds durable traction."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Padded collar","Diamond-stitched quilted tongue","Colour Shown: Light Crimson/Bright Crimson/Gym Red/White","Style: FB2237-600","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/bf324a92-3ce0-47ac-be18-193f39f79095/LEBRON+WITNESS+VIII+EP.png','737.29','2025-01-03 15:45:48.047559','2025-01-03 15:45:48.047559','football','men'),
	 ('ee570ce4-493f-4582-b1a1-2c363d61b890','Nike Terrascout','{"benefits":[{"header":"Step into exploration","body":["Rubber outsole with rugged tread pattern helps provide durable traction. Flex grooves in the outsole add flexibility, helping every step feel natural."]},{"header":"Easy to pull on","body":["Lowered back collar works with pull tabs on the tongue and heel to help make these easy to pull on."]},{"header":"Warm and cosy details","body":["Quilted fabric around the collar pairs with a soft fleece lining to help keep your feet warm in cold weather."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Classic laces","Reflective design details","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Sand Drift/Light British Tan/Seafoam/Baroque Brown","Style: HQ3472-122","Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/b2762ce4-fb6f-456a-b147-c05d150f0ae0/NIKE+TERRASCOUT+%28GS%29.png','752.07','2025-01-03 15:45:48.10446','2025-01-03 15:45:48.10446','football','men'),
	 ('d2dac9ff-82d5-4f0e-bb9a-e35d08d1f37c','Zion 3 ''Rising'' PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"Lateral action","body":["Side to side, left to right. Traction on the outsole helps you grip the court with every step, while a foam carrier in the midsole adds support for your ankle and heel."]},{"header":"Up fast, down hard","body":["A Nike Air unit helps you get those powerful ups when you blast off the court—and adds cushioning on re-entry."]},{"header":"Get low","body":["For improved ground feel, we dropped in some Formula 23 foam. It''s soft and responsive underfoot, helping you stay low in your movements."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: Bleached Coral/Pale Ivory/Glacier Blue/Crimson Tint","Style: FZ1322-601","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/78da61b0-ba14-47b6-9e7f-7b21139b0bee/JORDAN+ZION+3+NRG+PF.png','734.66','2025-01-03 15:45:48.059341','2025-01-03 15:45:48.059341','gym_and_training','men'),
	 ('c71c4eb8-ebaf-4eaa-b445-2b440c21aea7','Luka 3 PF ''Blurred Vision''','{"benefits":[{"header":"Locked-in support","body":["Containment is key when you''re tearing down the court. A strong yet flexible plate runs up the sidewall to help keep your foot secure as you shift gears. To reduce the shoe''s weight, we removed excess areas of the plate, keeping only what was needed. The result? Locked-in support in one lightweight package."]},{"header":"Cushioning 3.0","body":["Acceleration is all about explosive movement, and for that you need cushioning that''s springy and supportive. Full-length Cushlon 3.0 foam helps you smoothly transition from heel to toe as you drive to the bucket, adding responsive energy to every step."]},{"header":"Lightweight Comfort","body":["A seamless moulded upper with a medial cut-out helps provide lightweight comfort and structure without feeling too tight in the forefoot. Pair that with a lighter plate and you have a shoe built to help you move as fast as you see the game."]},{"header":"Look fast, feel fast","body":["Built with speed in mind, these shoes draw inspiration from Luka''s love of cars and spinning tyres to give you lightning-fast style. Racing stripes adorn the pull tab while tyre-like details decorate the outsole."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Pull tab on heel","The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: Vapour Green/Cone/Psychic Purple/Hyper Jade","Style: HQ5048-300","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/3fe719ae-5373-4c19-b8c8-d68df6ce1976/JORDAN+LUKA+3+PF.png','437.99','2025-01-03 15:45:48.048214','2025-01-03 15:45:48.048214','basketball','men'),
	 ('d6784be1-9eaa-4ba3-a10d-c138a8458a36','Tatum 2 ''Legacy'' PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"Contoured fit","body":["The frame wraps underneath the sole and onto the upper, helping support your low-to-the-ground gameplay."]},{"header":"Get grippy","body":["You''re always moving on the court. That''s where the rubber outsole and ground-contact foam come in—adding responsiveness and traction for your offence and defence."]},{"header":"Lightweight Build","body":["Every time you go up with a light shoe, you''re saving energy. We used rubber on the outsole (where you need it most) but foam with ample traction does the heavy lifting."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["PF edition is designed to fit wide for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: White/Black/Wolf Grey/Electric Green","Style: FJ6458-100","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/3bdf52f5-1615-4bdf-9936-355332055c21/JORDAN+TATUM+2+PF.png','751.66','2025-01-03 15:45:48.051436','2025-01-03 15:45:48.051436','gym_and_training','men'),
