	 ('b980140a-949d-401c-acd9-c65947d664f5','Nike Vaporfly 3','{"benefits":[{"header":"Propelling you forwards","body":["A full-length carbon-fibre Flyplate provides a stiff and propulsive feel."]},{"header":"Speed for miles","body":["Nike ZoomX, our most responsive foam, just got a little better. Running from heel to toe, it unlocks even more energy return than before, giving you a springy, bouncy feel."]},{"header":"Stable ride","body":["See how the midsole bulges out by the heel? We designed it that way to help reduce weight on the inside of the foot to give you a more stable ride."]},{"header":"Feel the breeze","body":["Specifically selected Flyknit yarns and engineered zones in the forefoot bring a new level of performance to the Vaporfly. Ample breathability around the toes combined with soft yet supportive yarns delivers our most customised upper for the Vaporfly. The result is a softer, cooler design that contours to your foot."]},{"header":"What''s new about the Vaporfly 3?","body":["An updated thin outsole rubber uses less material without sacrificing durability, which helps reduce outsole weight and thickness. This allows for extra millimetres of ZoomX foam underfoot and a smoother transition through your stride."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: Approx. 165 grams (women''s size 5.5)","Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm","Colour Shown: Mint Foam/Sunset Tint/Barely Volt/Sail","Style: HQ3505-379","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/33b7edd5-bc94-4929-b897-67ce249c69ce/W+ZOOMX+VAPORFLY+NEXT%25+3FK.png','497.62','2025-01-03 15:45:48.221062','2025-01-03 15:45:48.221062','basketball','women'),
	 ('e035707f-0270-451b-a219-f2f7db585af0','Nike Streetgato','{"benefits":[{"header":"Grip and Go","body":["Redesigned outsole provides non-stop traction for small-sided games."]},{"header":"Streetwear Performance","body":["The suede in the uppers offers an everyday look whether you''re playing on the street or keeping things casual."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Rubber outsole","Colour Shown: Deep Jungle/Green Frost","Style: DC8466-302","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/87e0c6d4-de2c-4b3c-b48f-e7f535db5ff9/NIKE+STREETGATO.png','717.80','2025-01-03 15:45:47.99524','2025-01-03 15:45:47.99524','gym_and_training','men'),
	 ('c5469f58-404a-4573-8a10-7ab4bc790ba3','Nike Juniper Trail 3','{"benefits":[{"header":"All-terrain ready","body":["The Nike Trail ATC outsole is made from an all-terrain compound that''s great even in wet weather. It provides grip on any surface while maintaining durability and a smooth ride on the road."]},{"header":"Smooth Ride","body":["The full-length foam midsole provides a soft and cushioned ride. A flexible midfoot system connects the upper and midsole for increased support and stability."]},{"header":"Soft touch","body":["We''ve softened the touch points along the collar foam and tongue to help minimise distractions."]},{"header":"Comfort and Containment","body":["Durable mesh provides comfort and containment."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: 272g approx. (women''s size 5.5)","Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm","Reflective design details","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Platinum Violet/Light Violet Ore/Armoury Navy/Metallic Silver","Style: FQ0902-002","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/77f54309-4f73-4323-8d8f-917fc5c8e902/W+NIKE+JUNIPER+TRAIL+3.png','440.68','2025-01-03 15:45:48.227479','2025-01-03 15:45:48.227479','basketball','women'),
	 ('77ed7154-2635-427b-b5e2-838605c69d4e','Nike Zegama 2','{"benefits":[{"header":"Stay sticky","body":["Vibram Zegama outsole made with Vibram Megagrip has a diverse lug pattern highlighted with wide spacing. This means you get traction for more technical terrains."]},{"header":"Keep running","body":["A lightweight Nike ZoomX midsole is combined with increased stack heights to help provide cushioning during extended stretches of running."]},{"header":"Stable for trails","body":["Engineered mesh—stronger and more flexible than normal mesh—on the upper helps provide stability for various trail conditions."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: 264g approx. (Women''s UK 5.5)","Heel-to-toe drop: 4mm","Reflective design details","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Daybreak/Cosmic Clay/Sundial/White","Style: FD5191-502","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/996afa1b-73a2-423e-a982-8dd7df14b0da/W+NIKE+ZOOMX+ZEGAMA+TRAIL+2.png','605.06','2025-01-03 15:45:48.23031','2025-01-03 15:45:48.23031','lifestyle','women'),
	 ('e657cdc4-d52b-49ea-a8ca-dac8febd2545','Nike React Phantom Run Flyknit 2','{"benefits":[{"header":"Smooth and Responsive","body":["Nike React technology delivers a soft, smooth, responsive ride. The shape of the foam midsole is all about zonal performance. It provides support for the 3 phases of a runner''s stride—flexibility at toe-off, a smooth ride at mid-stance and cushioning at contact."]},{"header":"Secure Feel","body":["The latest in Flywire technology features an elastic design that intertwines with the Flyknit upper, helping your foot feel secure as you run."]},{"header":"Lightweight and Breathable","body":["Flyknit Loft is the latest update to the popular material. 3 forefoot layers are combined for a lightweight, breathable and durable feel that keeps your foot comfortable."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Increased rubber on the outsole helps deliver traction and durability.","Moulding around the heel keeps you secure so you can focus on your route.","Offset: 10mm (Forefoot: 18.5mm, Heel: 28.5mm)","Colour Shown: Teal Tint/Aurora Green/White","Style: CJ0280-300","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/74934ec7-4f8f-4946-9322-c72346061cb3/W+NIKE+REACT+PHANTOM+RUN+FK+2.png','514.63','2025-01-03 15:45:48.233163','2025-01-03 15:45:48.233163','gym_and_training','women'),
	 ('0b0cddb9-a5aa-4b49-8be7-f239511e7578','Nike Air Max 90','{"benefits":[{"header":"Iconic Design","body":["The Nike Air Max 90 remains true to its roots with its classic design and visible Air cushioning."]},{"header":"All-Day Comfort","body":["Features a padded collar and tongue for enhanced comfort and support."]},{"header":"Durable Construction","body":["The durable upper and rubber outsole provide long-lasting wear."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Visible Air Cushioning","Leather and Textile Upper","Rubber Outsole","Style: CN8490-100","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4651ae27-84f5-4ed8-8a27-697ea68ac776/AIR+MAX+90.png','249.63','2025-03-05 15:26:25.307527','2025-03-05 15:26:25.307527','football','men'),
	 ('f5d532cd-ee36-45ce-8ce1-79516ae87b91','LeBron XXII ''Crown Jewel'' EP','{"benefits":[{"header":"Crown jewel","body":["This design has a gem-like glow—a bright-white upper with neon accents paired with a glow-in-the dark outsole at the forefoot. It reflects how the King embraces the pressures of being a professional athlete and a parent to win in all facets of his life."]},{"header":"Support and speed","body":["The large forefoot Air Zoom unit is curved to bend in multiple directions. It provides energy return for fast and responsive cornering and offers a flexible court feel that moves naturally with your foot. A bottom-loaded Air Zoom unit in the heel adds cushioning and support."]},{"header":"Stay Steady","body":["A tough plastic plate in the midsole and sturdy, wing-shaped pieces on both sides of the shoe help keep you stable."]},{"header":"Soft and smooth","body":["The responsive foam in the midsole feels soft and smooth while keeping you low to the ground and enhancing the sensation of court feel."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Synthetic leather upper","Multi-directional traction pattern","Colour Shown: White/Medium Ash/Hot Lava/Volt Glow","Style: FZ1095-101","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/91a51763-80fe-488e-a5b2-8f9aff4c9794/LEBRON+XXII+EP.png','600.29','2025-01-03 15:45:47.999121','2025-01-03 15:45:47.999121','football','men'),
	 ('b3dfd261-711b-46b7-8179-fbd29a3890cb','Tatum 3 PF ''Zen''','{"benefits":[{"header":"Conforms to your moves","body":["A contouring fit offers stretch and containment. We studied players in action and layered materials in the upper where it mattered most. The result? Shoes designed to keep up with your game."]},{"header":"Lightest in flight","body":["Less weight means more speed, and we''re all about speed. A flexible textile upper helps Tatum''s latest signature shoe continue the line''s reign as the lightest performance shoes in our collection—now that''s champ talk."]},{"header":"Traction for quick cuts","body":["The Cushlon foam and a springy Air Zoom unit help provide a smooth ride underfoot. They work alongside a firm frame to help you feel secure whether you''re getting up or making quick cuts."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["PF edition is designed to fit wide for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: Platinum Tint/Particle Grey/Grey Fog/Black","Style: FZ6601-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/4aa50aaf-1393-4c1d-8eb3-db2a1fb16714/JORDAN+TATUM+3+PF.png','489.04','2025-01-03 15:45:48.002132','2025-01-03 15:45:48.002132','football','men'),
	 ('0a5bf2e9-c06f-41bc-8aa8-afb7abee6e23','Nike Precision 7','{"benefits":[{"header":"All-game comfort","body":["The plush foam on the collar and tongue enhances the feeling of comfort around the ankle and over the top of the foot—areas where you want no distractions. It helps strike a sound balance between ground control when changing sudden direction and comfort when racing from one end of the floor to the other. The breathable mesh upper helps keep you contained."]},{"header":"Cushion for the push","body":["The sculpted foam midsole feels soft and supportive, providing cushioning for the game''s non-stop movement."]},{"header":"Stick and move","body":["Herringbone traction provides multi-directional grip, great for players who rely on their quickness and cutting ability. The rubber wraps up the sides in the forefoot to give you traction on your edges."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["No-sew overlays","Moulded Swoosh logo","Colour Shown: Black/University Red/White","Style: FN4322-002","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/e6cad6b9-b122-49d4-b15b-a504180b5a6c/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png','557.13','2025-01-03 15:45:48.004583','2025-01-03 15:45:48.004583','gym_and_training','men');
