	 ('acbee937-3128-4712-9003-edf44ee0f7d3','Luka 2 PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"Cushioned for Impact","body":["When you''re shifting side to side, you need support that''s firm—but not rigid. A wedge of cushioning in the midsole butts up against the medial sidewall so you can bank like a champ, and a thick, moulded insole helps you stay grounded."]},{"header":"Last-Step Efficiency","body":["The other aspect of side-to-side movement? Lateral support. To help your quick stops feel secure, we added a strong, flexible plate that runs up the lateral side wall, complemented by a firm foam carrier and Formula 23 foam in the midsole."]},{"header":"360 Degrees of Support","body":["A sturdy cage wraps around the entire upper for 360-degree connected support that help your feet stay securely contained, whichever way you step—or however quick you stop."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["The PF edition is designed with a wider fit and optimised for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: White/Hyper Pink/Black","Style: DX9012-106","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/2ba84c98-37f8-4bb3-96fb-33b72d6b4601/JORDAN+LUKA+2+PF.png','732.65','2025-01-03 15:45:48.052341','2025-01-03 15:45:48.052341','gym_and_training','men'),
