	 ('889dced4-411f-4342-879a-c92bc91f2e79','Nike Air Force 1 ''07','{"benefits":[{"header":"Iconic Style","body":["The Nike Air Force 1 ''07 is a timeless classic that continues to define sneaker culture. Its clean design and versatile style make it a must-have for any wardrobe."]},{"header":"All-Day Comfort","body":["Featuring Nike Air cushioning, the Air Force 1 ''07 provides exceptional comfort and support for all-day wear. Enjoy a smooth and comfortable ride, no matter where you go."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Upper: Leather","Midsole: Foam with Nike Air cushioning","Outsole: Non-marking rubber","Style: CW2288-111 (example)","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/4f37fca8-6bce-43e7-ad07-f57ae3c13142/AIR+FORCE+1+%2707.png','489.31','2025-03-05 15:26:25.185426','2025-03-05 15:26:25.185426','football','men'),
