	 ('2c84f536-099a-44c7-b892-b30b8ca0d5f6','Nike Air Max Dn Premium','{"benefits":[{"header":"Maxxed Out motion","body":["Our Dynamic Air unit system features 2 sets of dual-pressure tubes. With the firmest amount of pressure in the heel and the softest amount of pressure towards your midfoot, the air levels shift within each set for a smooth transition as you step."]},{"header":"Maxxed Out comfort","body":["The multi-layered mesh on the upper feels lightweight and breathable, with a haptic print for a textured look. Plush foam surrounds the cushioning system for an enhanced feel that''s uniquely soft and supportive."]},{"header":"Maxxed Out energy","body":["Providing comfort from top to bottom, this tactile design boasts performance-level bounce to energise your every move. After all, who said going to a concert isn''t a sport?"]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Metallic accents","Foam midsole","Rubber outsole","Colour Shown: Metallic Silver/White/Black/Metallic Silver","Style: HJ9638-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/6b5f86ee-d9eb-4e78-89a3-4f3978503ce2/W+AIR+MAX+DN+PRM.png','670.34','2025-01-03 15:45:48.201697','2025-01-03 15:45:48.201697','lifestyle','women'),
