	 ('e726d270-9513-47df-b275-61f6f264ab44','Nike Terrascout','{"benefits":[{"header":"Step into exploration","body":["Rubber outsole with rugged tread pattern helps provide durable traction. Flex grooves in the outsole add flexibility, helping every step feel natural."]},{"header":"Easy to pull on","body":["Lowered back collar works with pull tabs on the tongue and heel to help make these easy to pull on."]},{"header":"Warm and cosy details","body":["Quilted fabric around the collar pairs with a soft fleece lining to help keep your feet warm in cold weather."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Classic laces","Reflective design details","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Hemp/Burgundy Ash/Denim Turquoise/Pale Ivory","Style: FV4173-200","Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/aed680ec-8d69-4d01-b354-eb9273a6cbd0/NIKE+TERRASCOUT+%28GS%29.png','728.26','2025-01-03 15:45:48.205028','2025-01-03 15:45:48.205028','gym_and_training','women'),
