	 ('417c499c-c71b-4742-bd4a-84812385a306','Nike V2K Run','{"benefits":[{"header":"Y2K Inspired Design","body":["The Nike V2K Run blends throwback aesthetics with modern comfort. Its design pulls inspiration from the early 2000s running shoe craze, offering a unique blend of style and performance."]},{"header":"Cushioned Comfort for All-Day Wear","body":["Designed with a cushioned midsole, the V2K Run delivers lasting comfort whether you''re running errands or hitting the streets. The breathable upper helps keep your feet cool."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Mesh and synthetic upper for breathability and durability","Cushioned midsole for all-day comfort","Rubber outsole for reliable traction","Reflective detailing for enhanced visibility","Style: HF0726-100 (Example Style Code - may vary)"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/a8ae66e9-92bf-41bc-ab98-b33828503caa/NIKE+V2K+RUN.png','283.04','2025-03-05 15:26:25.238884','2025-03-05 15:26:25.238884','football','men'),
