	 ('77286166-dd9c-46d5-ae00-b16402317879','Nike Air Max 2013','{"benefits":[{"header":"Retro Running Style","body":["The Nike Air Max 2013 brings back a classic running silhouette with modern updates, offering a comfortable and stylish look for everyday wear."]},{"header":"Cushioned Comfort","body":["The full-length Max Air unit provides exceptional cushioning and a smooth ride, while the breathable upper keeps your feet cool and comfortable. "]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Upper: Mesh and Synthetic Materials","Midsole: Full-Length Max Air Unit","Outsole: Rubber","Style: Lifestyle/Running","Reflective details for visibility"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/41472177-40a7-42a3-abef-80c54c53b938/AIR+MAX+2013.png','463.30','2025-03-05 15:26:25.485711','2025-03-05 15:26:25.485711','gym_and_training','men'),
