	 ('23d2d489-31e8-4b9e-8a2f-b1a7a0e417e8','Nike Precision 7','{"benefits":[{"header":"Enhanced Court Feel","body":["The Precision 7 allows you to feel connected to the court, providing the responsiveness and control you need to make quick decisions."]},{"header":"Supportive and Secure","body":["The shoe''s design delivers a supportive and secure fit, giving you the confidence to move freely and aggressively on the court."]},{"header":"Cushioned Comfort","body":["Experience lasting comfort with the shoe''s cushioning system, designed to absorb impact and provide support during intense gameplay."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Mid-top design for support","Durable outsole for traction","Cushioned midsole for comfort","Colour Shown: White/Blue","Style: FQ4632-100"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/8aa319b2-0fec-411c-97af-2dea36e41e00/NIKE+PRECISION+VII.png','219.55','2025-03-05 15:26:25.592193','2025-03-05 15:26:25.592193','football','men'),
