	 ('d44bc234-4312-491a-8109-5730efba4ca7','Nike Air Force 1 ''07','{"benefits":[{"header":"Timeless Style","body":["The Air Force 1 ''07 is a classic silhouette that never goes out of style.","Crisp leather and iconic design details offer a premium look and feel."]},{"header":"Durable Comfort","body":["The durable construction and comfortable cushioning make these sneakers perfect for everyday wear.","Padded collar provides a comfortable fit."]},{"header":"Iconic Design","body":["Perforations enhance ventilation, keeping your feet cool."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Leather upper","Foam midsole with Air cushioning","Rubber outsole","Style: Nike Air Force 1 ''07","Country/Region of Origin: Varies"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/bd6ac692-d50b-4cfd-892f-b60669d9cc1d/WMNS+AIR+FORCE+1+%2707.png','285.72','2025-03-05 16:04:47.962792','2025-03-05 16:04:47.962792','football','women'),
