	 ('28079f81-0f1b-4670-8777-e6f767e3b877','Nike Phantom Luna 2 Elite Electric','{"benefits":[{"header":"Precision Agility","body":["Designed specifically for women''s feet, the Phantom Luna 2 Elite offers unparalleled agility and control on the pitch.","Experience enhanced responsiveness and a natural feel for the ball, allowing you to dominate the game."]},{"header":"Enhanced Traction","body":["The innovative Cyclone 360 traction pattern provides exceptional grip and allows for quick cuts and turns with confidence.","Maintain your stability and stay one step ahead of the competition."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Flyknit upper for a lightweight and breathable feel","Firm-ground (FG) cleats for use on natural grass pitches","Asymmetrical lacing system for increased strike zone","NikeSkin overlay for enhanced ball touch","Style: Electric Purple/Orange"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/641c2ad1-800d-469a-9b5b-55b69ec6be60/PHANTOM+LUNA+II+ELITE+FG.png','480.11','2025-03-05 16:04:48.069821','2025-03-05 16:04:48.069821','football','women'),
